Fetched at build time, shipped inside the packaged application
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These assets are not stored in this repository. They are downloaded from their
vendor's canonical origin at build time, pinned by sha256 or commit, and bundled
into the desktop application. Each carries its own licence, and the script that
fetches it names the origin it must come from:

  Tesseract language data (tesseract-ocr/tessdata_fast), Apache License 2.0
      apps/desktop/scripts/bake-tesseract-langs.ts
  docTR text-detection and recognition models (Mindee), Apache License 2.0
      apps/desktop/scripts/bake-doctr-models.ts
  Multilingual NER weights (a Hugging Face re-export of mBERT), Apache License 2.0
      apps/desktop/scripts/bake-ner-models.ts
  On-device embedding models
      apps/desktop/scripts/bake-embed-models.ts
  A CPython runtime and the wheels of the sandboxed interpreter
      apps/desktop/scripts/bake-python-runtime.ts

A copy of this file and of the Apache License 2.0 ships inside the packaged
application, under its resources directory.

